# Example Caddy v2 site for TLS in front of friend-mesh when Nexo.API is published on loopback:8080.
# Install Caddy on the host (or run caddy in its own container with host network / correct upstream).
#
# 1. Copy to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile (or your path) and replace nexo.example.com with your DNS name.
# 2. Point DNS A/AAAA at this host.
# 3. Ensure deploy/compose/docker-compose.friend-mesh.yml publishes 127.0.0.1:8080 (default).
# 4. `caddy run` (or systemctl start caddy).

nexo.example.com {
    encode gzip
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
